 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted: ISB Operations/ESA (objective), Coruscant (SL), Prepared Defenses (SI), and three effects marked (SE) - Mob. Points, IAO and Something Special Planned for Them (the strategy says he starts all three Endor/DSII effects); all count toward the total. starting.effect is left null because three effects start.",
  "Posted 'Coruscant (SL)' dested the Dark Special Edition system Coruscant (Dark) (Special Edition), the only Dark Coruscant printed by May 2001; 'Endor', 'Sullust' and 'Kashyyyk' dested the Dark printings.",
  "Posted '(SE)' read as 'starting effect', not Special Edition: Mobilization Points and Something Special Planned For Them are Death Star II cards, Imperial Arrest Order is Endor.",
  "Posted 'IAO (SE)' dested Imperial Arrest Order (the draft had dropped it). Secret Plans is the 2001 Special Edition Effect, not the Reflections III shield.",
  "Posted 'Ghhk/Those Rebels...' dested Ghhhk & Those Rebels Won't Escape Us; 'EPP Vader' Darth Vader With Lightsaber; 'BiHT' Bossk In Hound's Tooth; 'ZiMH' Zuckuss In Mist Hunter; 'Vader's Personnel Shuttle' Vader's Personal Shuttle; 'ExecutorDB' Executor: Docking Bay; 'EndorDB' the Dark Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay).",
  "'Grabber' is kept as written (UNKNOWN): the post does not name the card.",
